<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not well established -USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not well established -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested on a live basis, compared with Thursday's close, USDA said. On a carcass basis, steers and heifers not well tested. Steers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1250 lbs pt ld 106.00 Heifers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1150-1200 lbs few 106.00 Reported sales for Friday: 200 Week to Date: 200</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
